"Finite Element Analysis — Plate-Thin Batoz DKQ (= SAP 2000)
'<hr/>
'<h4>Input data</h4>
'<table><tr><td>
'Slab dimensions -'a = 6'm,'b = 4'm
'Thickness -'t = 0.1'm
'Load -'q = 10'kN/m²
'Modulus of elasticity -'E = 35000'MPa
'Poisson`s ratio -'ν = 0.15
'</td><td><img src="https://calcpad.eu/media/mechanics/elastic/slab.png" style="height:110pt; margin-left:40pt;"></td></tr></table>

'<h4>Elemento finito: Batoz-Tahar DKQ (Discrete Kirchhoff Quadrilateral)</h4>
'<p>Misma formulación que <strong>SAP 2000 Plate-Thin</strong> (Wilson DKE).</p>
'<ul>
'<li><strong>12 GDL/elemento</strong> · 3 GDL/nodo: w, β<sub>x</sub>=∂w/∂x, β<sub>y</sub>=∂w/∂y</li>
'<li>Rotaciones interpoladas con <strong>Serendipity Q8</strong> (4 esquinas + 4 midsides)</li>
'<li>Mid-side DOFs condensadas por restricción <strong>Kirchhoff discreto</strong></li>
'<li>K<sub>e</sub> integrado por <strong>cuadratura 2×2 Gauss</strong> (under-integration típica DKQ)</li>
'</ul>

'<h4>Discretización</h4>
'Number of elements along <var>a</var> and <var>b</var> -'n_a = 6', 'n_b = 4
'Total number of elements -'n_e = n_a*n_b
'Total number of joints -'n_j = (n_a + 1)*(n_b + 1)
n = 12  ' DOFs por elemento
n_dof = 3  ' DOFs por nodo (w, βx, βy)
'Element dimensions -'a_1 = a/n_a', 'b_1 = b/n_b
a_h = a_1/2
b_h = b_1/2
'Supported joints count -'n_s = 2*(n_a + n_b)

#hide
'Mesh generation (igual que el .cpd BFS oficial)
x_j = vector(n_j)','y_j = vector(n_j)
x = 0', 'y = 0
#for j = 1 : n_j
	x_j.j = x
	y_j.j = y
	y = y + b_1
	#if y > b
		y = 0
		x = x + a_1
	#end if
#loop
e_j = matrix(n_e; 4)
#for i_a = 1 : n_a
	#for i_b = 1 : n_b
		e = i_b + n_b*(i_a - 1)
		j = e + i_a - 1
		e_j.(e; 1) = j
		e_j.(e; 2) = j + n_b + 1
		e_j.(e; 3) = j + n_b + 2
		e_j.(e; 4) = j + 1
	#loop
#loop
s_j = vector(n_s)
i_s = 0
#for i = 1 : n_a + 1
	j = (n_b + 1)*i - n_b
	i_s = i_s + 1
	s_j.i_s = j
#loop
#for i = 1 : n_a + 1
	j = (n_b + 1)*i
	i_s = i_s + 1
	s_j.i_s = j
#loop
#for i = 2 : n_b
	j = i
	i_s = i_s + 1
	s_j.i_s = j
#loop
#for i = 2 : n_b
	j = n_a*(n_b + 1) + i
	i_s = i_s + 1
	s_j.i_s = j
#loop
#show

'<h4>Matriz constitutiva D (bending)</h4>
D = E*t^3/(12*(1 - ν^2))*[1; ν; 0|ν; 1; 0|0; 0; (1 - ν)/2]

'<h4>Cuadratura 2×2 Gauss en [-1, +1]</h4>
gp = [-1/sqrt(3); 1/sqrt(3)]
gw = [1; 1]

'<h4>Coeficientes Kirchhoff discreto</h4>
c_a = 1.5/a_1
c_b = 1.5/b_1

'<h4>Funciones de forma Q8 Serendipity</h4>
'<p>Corners (k=1..4) en (ξ,η) = (-1,-1), (+1,-1), (+1,+1), (-1,+1):</p>
N1q(x; y) = (1 - x)*(1 - y)*(-x - y - 1)/4
N2q(x; y) = (1 + x)*(1 - y)*( x - y - 1)/4
N3q(x; y) = (1 + x)*(1 + y)*( x + y - 1)/4
N4q(x; y) = (1 - x)*(1 + y)*(-x + y - 1)/4
'<p>Midsides (k=5..8) en (0,-1), (+1,0), (0,+1), (-1,0):</p>
N5q(x; y) = (1 - x^2)*(1 - y)/2
N6q(x; y) = (1 + x)*(1 - y^2)/2
N7q(x; y) = (1 - x^2)*(1 + y)/2
N8q(x; y) = (1 - x)*(1 - y^2)/2

'<p>Derivadas ∂N/∂ξ:</p>
dN1q_dx(x; y) = (1 - y)*(2*x + y)/4
dN2q_dx(x; y) = (1 - y)*(2*x - y)/4
dN3q_dx(x; y) = (1 + y)*(2*x + y)/4
dN4q_dx(x; y) = (1 + y)*(2*x - y)/4
dN5q_dx(x; y) = -x*(1 - y)
dN6q_dx(x; y) = (1 - y^2)/2
dN7q_dx(x; y) = -x*(1 + y)
dN8q_dx(x; y) = -(1 - y^2)/2

'<p>Derivadas ∂N/∂η:</p>
dN1q_dy(x; y) = (1 - x)*(x + 2*y)/4
dN2q_dy(x; y) = (1 + x)*(-x + 2*y)/4
dN3q_dy(x; y) = (1 + x)*(x + 2*y)/4
dN4q_dy(x; y) = (1 - x)*(-x + 2*y)/4
dN5q_dy(x; y) = -(1 - x^2)/2
dN6q_dy(x; y) = -y*(1 + x)
dN7q_dy(x; y) = (1 - x^2)/2
dN8q_dy(x; y) = -y*(1 - x)

'<h4>B matrix (3 × 12) en (ξ, η) — DKQ con substitución de midsides</h4>
'<p>Substitución Kirchhoff discreto:</p>
'<ul>
'<li>βx<sub>5</sub> = c_a·(w<sub>2</sub>−w<sub>1</sub>) − 0.25·(βx<sub>1</sub>+βx<sub>2</sub>)</li>
'<li>βy<sub>5</sub> = 0.5·(βy<sub>1</sub>+βy<sub>2</sub>)  &nbsp;&nbsp; (interp normal)</li>
'<li>βx<sub>6</sub> = 0.5·(βx<sub>2</sub>+βx<sub>3</sub>)  &nbsp;&nbsp; βy<sub>6</sub> = c_b·(w<sub>3</sub>−w<sub>2</sub>) − 0.25·(βy<sub>2</sub>+βy<sub>3</sub>)</li>
'<li>βx<sub>7</sub> = c_a·(w<sub>3</sub>−w<sub>4</sub>) − 0.25·(βx<sub>3</sub>+βx<sub>4</sub>)  &nbsp; βy<sub>7</sub> = 0.5·(βy<sub>3</sub>+βy<sub>4</sub>)</li>
'<li>βx<sub>8</sub> = 0.5·(βx<sub>4</sub>+βx<sub>1</sub>)  &nbsp;&nbsp; βy<sub>8</sub> = c_b·(w<sub>4</sub>−w<sub>1</sub>) − 0.25·(βy<sub>1</sub>+βy<sub>4</sub>)</li>
'</ul>

'<p>Cada entrada de B(3×12) en función de DOF j ∈ {1..12} con orden [w<sub>1</sub>, βx<sub>1</sub>, βy<sub>1</sub>, w<sub>2</sub>, βx<sub>2</sub>, βy<sub>2</sub>, w<sub>3</sub>, βx<sub>3</sub>, βy<sub>3</sub>, w<sub>4</sub>, βx<sub>4</sub>, βy<sub>4</sub>]:</p>

'<p><b>Fórmulas que se construyen (visualización HTML):</b></p>
'<div style="background:#f8f4e8; padding:8px 14px; border-left:3px solid #b08d4f; font-family:Cambria Math,serif; font-size:1.0em; margin:8px 0">
'β<sub>x</sub>(ξ, η) = Σ<sub>k=1..8</sub> N<sub>k</sub>(ξ, η) · β<sub>xk</sub><br>
'β<sub>y</sub>(ξ, η) = Σ<sub>k=1..8</sub> N<sub>k</sub>(ξ, η) · β<sub>yk</sub><br>
'κ<sub>x</sub> = ∂β<sub>x</sub>/∂x &nbsp;·&nbsp; κ<sub>y</sub> = ∂β<sub>y</sub>/∂y &nbsp;·&nbsp; 2·κ<sub>xy</sub> = ∂β<sub>x</sub>/∂y + ∂β<sub>y</sub>/∂x<br>
'<b>M</b> = -<b>D</b> · [κ<sub>x</sub>; κ<sub>y</sub>; 2·κ<sub>xy</sub>]<sup>T</sup>
'</div>

'<p><b>Restricciones Kirchhoff discreto en midsides:</b></p>
'<div style="background:#f8f4e8; padding:8px 14px; border-left:3px solid #b08d4f; font-family:Cambria Math,serif; font-size:0.95em; margin:8px 0">
'β<sub>x5</sub> = (3/2a<sub>1</sub>) · (w<sub>2</sub> − w<sub>1</sub>) − (1/4) · (β<sub>x1</sub> + β<sub>x2</sub>)<br>
'β<sub>y5</sub> = (β<sub>y1</sub> + β<sub>y2</sub>) / 2<br>
'β<sub>x6</sub> = (β<sub>x2</sub> + β<sub>x3</sub>) / 2 &nbsp;·&nbsp; β<sub>y6</sub> = (3/2b<sub>1</sub>) · (w<sub>3</sub> − w<sub>2</sub>) − (1/4) · (β<sub>y2</sub> + β<sub>y3</sub>)<br>
'β<sub>x7</sub> = (3/2a<sub>1</sub>) · (w<sub>3</sub> − w<sub>4</sub>) − (1/4) · (β<sub>x3</sub> + β<sub>x4</sub>) &nbsp;·&nbsp; β<sub>y7</sub> = (β<sub>y3</sub> + β<sub>y4</sub>) / 2<br>
'β<sub>x8</sub> = (β<sub>x4</sub> + β<sub>x1</sub>) / 2 &nbsp;·&nbsp; β<sub>y8</sub> = (3/2b<sub>1</sub>) · (w<sub>4</sub> − w<sub>1</sub>) − (1/4) · (β<sub>y1</sub> + β<sub>y4</sub>)
'</div>

'∂Hx/∂ξ (j; ξ; η) — derivada en ξ de la interp Hx para DOF j
dHxdxi(j; x; y) = take(j; _
  -c_a*dN5q_dx(x; y); _
  dN1q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN5q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN8q_dx(x; y); _
  0; _
  c_a*dN5q_dx(x; y); _
  dN2q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN5q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN6q_dx(x; y); _
  0; _
  c_a*dN7q_dx(x; y); _
  dN3q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN6q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN7q_dx(x; y); _
  0; _
  -c_a*dN7q_dx(x; y); _
  dN4q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN7q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN8q_dx(x; y); _
  0)

'∂Hx/∂η (j; ξ; η)
dHxdeta(j; x; y) = take(j; _
  -c_a*dN5q_dy(x; y); _
  dN1q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN5q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN8q_dy(x; y); _
  0; _
  c_a*dN5q_dy(x; y); _
  dN2q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN5q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN6q_dy(x; y); _
  0; _
  c_a*dN7q_dy(x; y); _
  dN3q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN6q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN7q_dy(x; y); _
  0; _
  -c_a*dN7q_dy(x; y); _
  dN4q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN7q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN8q_dy(x; y); _
  0)

'∂Hy/∂ξ (j; ξ; η)
dHydxi(j; x; y) = take(j; _
  -c_b*dN8q_dx(x; y); _
  0; _
  dN1q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN5q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN8q_dx(x; y); _
  -c_b*dN6q_dx(x; y); _
  0; _
  dN2q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN5q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN6q_dx(x; y); _
  c_b*dN6q_dx(x; y); _
  0; _
  dN3q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN6q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN7q_dx(x; y); _
  c_b*dN8q_dx(x; y); _
  0; _
  dN4q_dx(x; y) + 0.5*dN7q_dx(x; y) - 0.25*dN8q_dx(x; y))

'∂Hy/∂η (j; ξ; η)
dHydeta(j; x; y) = take(j; _
  -c_b*dN8q_dy(x; y); _
  0; _
  dN1q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN5q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN8q_dy(x; y); _
  -c_b*dN6q_dy(x; y); _
  0; _
  dN2q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN5q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN6q_dy(x; y); _
  c_b*dN6q_dy(x; y); _
  0; _
  dN3q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN6q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN7q_dy(x; y); _
  c_b*dN8q_dy(x; y); _
  0; _
  dN4q_dy(x; y) + 0.5*dN7q_dy(x; y) - 0.25*dN8q_dy(x; y))

'<p>Filas de B (cada una un vector 1×12):</p>
'B[1, j] = (1/a_h) ∂Hx/∂ξ
'B[2, j] = (1/b_h) ∂Hy/∂η
'B[3, j] = (1/b_h) ∂Hx/∂η + (1/a_h) ∂Hy/∂ξ
B_row1(j; x; y) = dHxdxi(j; x; y)/a_h
B_row2(j; x; y) = dHydeta(j; x; y)/b_h
B_row3(j; x; y) = dHxdeta(j; x; y)/b_h + dHydxi(j; x; y)/a_h

'B(j; ξ; η) — columna j de la matriz B (vector 3×1)
B(j; x; y) = [B_row1(j; x; y); B_row2(j; x; y); B_row3(j; x; y)]

'<h4>K_e por cuadratura 2×2 Gauss</h4>
'<p><b>Fórmulas (visualización):</b></p>
'<div style="background:#f8f4e8; padding:8px 14px; border-left:3px solid #b08d4f; font-family:Cambria Math,serif; font-size:1.0em; margin:8px 0">
'<b>K</b><sub>e,ij</sub> = a<sub>h</sub>·b<sub>h</sub>·Σ<sub>g=1..4</sub> w<sub>g</sub> · <b>B</b><sub>i</sub>(ξ<sub>g</sub>, η<sub>g</sub>)<sup>T</sup> · <b>D</b> · <b>B</b><sub>j</sub>(ξ<sub>g</sub>, η<sub>g</sub>)<br>
'<b>F</b><sub>e,i</sub> = q · a<sub>1</sub> · b<sub>1</sub> / 4 &nbsp; para i ∈ {1, 4, 7, 10} &nbsp; (DOFs de w)<br>
'<b>F</b><sub>e,i</sub> = 0 &nbsp; para los demás (DOFs de β<sub>x</sub>, β<sub>y</sub>)
'</div>

'<p>K_e(i; j) = sum over 4 Gauss points of B(i)^T · D · B(j) · a_h·b_h·w</p>
BTDB(i; j; x; y) = transp(B(i; x; y))*D*B(j; x; y)

'Sum over 2×2 Gauss explícito
K_e_ij(i; j) = a_h*b_h*( _
  gw.1*gw.1*BTDB(i; j; gp.1; gp.1) + _
  gw.2*gw.1*BTDB(i; j; gp.2; gp.1) + _
  gw.1*gw.2*BTDB(i; j; gp.1; gp.2) + _
  gw.2*gw.2*BTDB(i; j; gp.2; gp.2))

#hide
K_e = utriang(n)
Precision = 10^-6
$Repeat{$Repeat{K_e.(i; j) = K_e_ij(i; j) @ j = i : n} @ i = 1 : n}
#show
'Matriz K_e (triangular superior, 12×12):
K_e

'<h4>Vector de cargas F_e (consistent Q4 bilineal)</h4>
'<p>F_e = q·a_1·b_1/4 en cada DOF de w (1, 4, 7, 10), 0 en β:</p>
#hide
F_e = vector(n)
F_e.1 = q*a_1*b_1/4
F_e.4 = q*a_1*b_1/4
F_e.7 = q*a_1*b_1/4
F_e.10 = q*a_1*b_1/4
#show
F_e'kN

'<h4>Ensamblaje K global</h4>
#hide
k_1 = n/4
n_g = k_1*n_j
K = symmetric(n_g)
#for e = 1 : n_e
	#for i = 1 : 4
		#for j = i : 4
			j_1 = e_j.(e; i)
			j_2 = e_j.(e; j)
			i_1 = k_1*(j_1 - 1) + 1
			i_2 = k_1*(j_2 - 1) + 1
			k_ij = submatrix(K_e; k_1*(i - 1) + 1; k_1*i; k_1*(j - 1) + 1; k_1*j)
			#if j_1 > j_2
				add(transp(k_ij); K; i_2; i_1)
			#else
				add(k_ij; K; i_1; i_2)
			#end if
		#loop
	#loop
#loop
k_s = 10^20
'BC: hard SS (igual SAP 2000 s2k)
'  corner (x ∈ {0,a} AND y ∈ {0,b}): w + βx + βy todos
'  edge x=0/a: w + βy (∂w/∂y=0)
'  edge y=0/b: w + βx (∂w/∂x=0)
#for i = 1 : n_s
	j_s = s_j.i
	g = k_1*(j_s - 1) + 1
	K.(g; g) = K.(g; g) + k_s
	#if x_j.j_s ≡ 0 ∨ x_j.j_s ≡ a
		#if y_j.j_s ≡ 0 ∨ y_j.j_s ≡ b
			K.(g + 1; g + 1) = K.(g + 1; g + 1) + k_s
			K.(g + 2; g + 2) = K.(g + 2; g + 2) + k_s
		#else
			K.(g + 2; g + 2) = K.(g + 2; g + 2) + k_s
		#end if
	#else
		K.(g + 1; g + 1) = K.(g + 1; g + 1) + k_s
	#end if
#loop

'<h4>Vector de cargas global</h4>
F = vector(n_g)
#for e = 1 : n_e
	#for i = 1 : 4
		j_e = e_j.(e; i)
		#for k = 1 : k_1
			l = k_1*(j_e - 1) + k
			F.l = F.l + F_e.(k_1*(i - 1) + k)
		#loop
	#loop
#loop
#show
F'kN

'<h4>Solución del sistema</h4>
Z = clsolve(K; F)

'<h4>Resultados</h4>
'<p><strong>Deflexión vertical w</strong> (mm)</p>
#hide
W_z = matrix(n_a + 1; n_b + 1)
w(j) = Z.(k_1*j - (k_1 - 1))     ' = Z.(3*j - 2)
$Repeat{$Repeat{W_z.(i; j) = round(w((i - 1)*(n_b + 1) + j)*1000)/1000 @ j = 1 : n_b + 1} @ i = 1 : n_a + 1}
w(x; y) = spline(1 + x/a_1; 1 + y/b_1; W_z)
PlotWidth = 50*a
PlotHeight = 50*b
PlotStep = 10
#show
transp(W_z)'mm
'<p>Mapa de deflexión (signo negativo = baja):</p>
$Map{-w(x; y) @ x = 0 : a & y = 0 : b}
'<p>Deflexión en el centro:</p>
w(a/2; b/2)'mm

'<h4>Momentos flectores</h4>
'<p><b>Fórmula de recovery (visualización):</b></p>
'<div style="background:#f8f4e8; padding:8px 14px; border-left:3px solid #b08d4f; font-family:Cambria Math,serif; font-size:1.0em; margin:8px 0">
'<b>M</b>(ξ, η) = −<b>D</b> · <b>B</b>(ξ, η) · <b>Z</b><sub>e</sub> &nbsp;(evaluado en cada Gauss point)<br>
'<b>M</b><sub>corner,c</sub> = Σ<sub>g=1..4</sub> N<sub>g</sub>(√3·ξ<sub>c</sub>, √3·η<sub>c</sub>) · <b>M</b>(ξ<sub>g</sub>, η<sub>g</sub>) &nbsp;(extrapolación bilineal)
'</div>
'<p>Recovery: 2×2 Gauss + extrapolación bilineal a esquinas (= SAP 2000)</p>
'Z_j(j) extrae los 3 DOF del nodo j
Z_j(j) = slice(Z; k_1*(j - 1) + 1; k_1*j)
'Z_e(e) extrae los 12 DOF del elemento e
Z_e(e) = [Z_j(e_j.(e; 1)); Z_j(e_j.(e; 2)); Z_j(e_j.(e; 3)); Z_j(e_j.(e; 4))]

#hide
'B en (ξ, η) como matriz 3×12 — para evaluar Z_e^T · B^T · D · B · Z_e
'Cada columna es B(j; ξ; η) — concatenar las 12
B_full(x; y) = [ _
  B_row1(1;x;y); B_row1(2;x;y); B_row1(3;x;y); B_row1(4;x;y); _
  B_row1(5;x;y); B_row1(6;x;y); B_row1(7;x;y); B_row1(8;x;y); _
  B_row1(9;x;y); B_row1(10;x;y); B_row1(11;x;y); B_row1(12;x;y) | _
  B_row2(1;x;y); B_row2(2;x;y); B_row2(3;x;y); B_row2(4;x;y); _
  B_row2(5;x;y); B_row2(6;x;y); B_row2(7;x;y); B_row2(8;x;y); _
  B_row2(9;x;y); B_row2(10;x;y); B_row2(11;x;y); B_row2(12;x;y) | _
  B_row3(1;x;y); B_row3(2;x;y); B_row3(3;x;y); B_row3(4;x;y); _
  B_row3(5;x;y); B_row3(6;x;y); B_row3(7;x;y); B_row3(8;x;y); _
  B_row3(9;x;y); B_row3(10;x;y); B_row3(11;x;y); B_row3(12;x;y)]

'Momento en (ξ, η) para elemento e (vector 3×1: Mx, My, Mxy)
M_e_at(e; x; y) = -D*B_full(x; y)*Z_e(e)

'Evaluar en 4 Gauss points y extrapolar a 4 esquinas
sqr3 = sqrt(3)
M_j = matrix(3; n_j)
c_j = vector(n_j)

#for e = 1 : n_e
	'Calcular M en los 4 Gauss points
	M_g1 = M_e_at(e; gp.1; gp.1)
	M_g2 = M_e_at(e; gp.2; gp.1)
	M_g3 = M_e_at(e; gp.1; gp.2)
	M_g4 = M_e_at(e; gp.2; gp.2)
	'Extrapolar a 4 esquinas con N_k(sqrt(3)·ξ_c, sqrt(3)·η_c)
	#for c = 1 : 4
		#if c ≡ 1
			x_c = -1
			y_c = -1
		#else
			#if c ≡ 2
				x_c = 1
				y_c = -1
			#else
				#if c ≡ 3
					x_c = 1
					y_c = 1
				#else
					x_c = -1
					y_c = 1
				#end if
			#end if
		#end if
		'Coords Gauss: g1=(-,-), g2=(+,-), g3=(-,+), g4=(+,+)
		N_g1 = (1 + (-1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + (-1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
		N_g2 = (1 + ( 1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + (-1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
		N_g3 = (1 + (-1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + ( 1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
		N_g4 = (1 + ( 1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + ( 1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
		M_corner = N_g1*M_g1 + N_g2*M_g2 + N_g3*M_g3 + N_g4*M_g4
		j_nod = e_j.(e; c)
		M_j.(1; j_nod) = M_j.(1; j_nod) + M_corner.1
		M_j.(2; j_nod) = M_j.(2; j_nod) + M_corner.2
		M_j.(3; j_nod) = M_j.(3; j_nod) + M_corner.3
		c_j.j_nod = c_j.j_nod + 1
	#loop
#loop

'Promediar
#for j = 1 : n_j
	#if c_j.j > 0
		M_j.(1; j) = M_j.(1; j)/c_j.j
		M_j.(2; j) = M_j.(2; j)/c_j.j
		M_j.(3; j) = M_j.(3; j)/c_j.j
	#end if
#loop

'Reorganizar a grillas (n_a+1) × (n_b+1)
Mx = matrix(n_a + 1; n_b + 1)
My = matrix(n_a + 1; n_b + 1)
Mxy = matrix(n_a + 1; n_b + 1)
#for i = 1 : n_a + 1
	#for kk = 1 : n_b + 1
		j_grid = (i - 1)*(n_b + 1) + kk
		Mx.(i; kk) = M_j.(1; j_grid)
		My.(i; kk) = M_j.(2; j_grid)
		Mxy.(i; kk) = M_j.(3; j_grid)
	#loop
#loop
M_x(x; y) = spline(1 + x/a_1; 1 + y/b_1; Mx)
M_y(x; y) = spline(1 + x/a_1; 1 + y/b_1; My)
M_xy(x; y) = spline(1 + x/a_1; 1 + y/b_1; Mxy)
#show

'<p><strong>M<sub>x</sub></strong> en grilla (kNm/m):</p>
transp(Mx)'kNm/m
$Map{M_x(x; y) @ x = 0 : a & y = 0 : b}
'<p>M<sub>x</sub> en el centro (a/2, b/2):</p>
M_x(a/2; b/2)'kNm/m

'<p><strong>M<sub>y</sub></strong> en grilla (kNm/m):</p>
transp(My)'kNm/m
$Map{M_y(x; y) @ x = 0 : a & y = 0 : b}
'<p>M<sub>y</sub> en el centro (a/2, b/2):</p>
M_y(a/2; b/2)'kNm/m

'<p><strong>M<sub>xy</sub></strong> en grilla (kNm/m):</p>
transp(Mxy)'kNm/m
$Map{M_xy(x; y) @ x = 0 : a & y = 0 : b}
'<p>M<sub>xy</sub> en la esquina (0, 0):</p>
M_xy(0; 0)'kNm/m

